    },
    {
      "text": "Before filing, the lawyer got suspicious, so he asked the chatbot, \"Are these cases real?\" And the chatbot said, \"Yes.\" That is like asking the guy who sold you the watch whether the watch is real.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1026,
      "why": "Memorable argument against self-verification as a hallucination control."
    },
    {
      "text": "When someone points at a sentence and says, \"Show me where this come from.\" You either click once or land on exact source paragraph, or you open seven browser tabs and start swiping.",
