    },
    {
      "text": "You can't outsource accountability to your own software. At the bottom of every real decision, a human signs.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1161,
      "why": "States the legal and organizational limit on autonomy in high-stakes workflows."
    },
    {
      "text": "If your architecture doesn't have a fundable human at the end of it, you you have not built a product. You have have built an excuse generator.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1228,
